  "name": "Question 1",
  "problem": "Convert $\\frac{17}{8}$ into a decimal using long division.",
  "worked_solution": "To write down the given fraction as a decimal, we need to divide the numerator by the denominator:\n\n$$\n17÷8\n$$\n\nWe proceed using the long division as usual, stopping once we obtain a remainder of $0:$\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"150\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"left\"></td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"left\">$\\,\\,\\,2\\,.\\,1\\,2\\,5$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"left\">$\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{1\\,\\phantom{|}7\\,.\\,0\\,\\phantom{|}0\\,\\phantom{|}0}$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$6$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$6$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$4$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$4$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p></p></td> \n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{17}{8}=2.125.\n$$",
